animatrix — provenance notice

All code in this repository was written from scratch (clean-room with respect to code). No
source code was copied or ported from the projects below. Their source files were read for
protocol facts only: byte values, packet layouts, the C5 bit layout and per-row LED geometry
formulas, which are not copyrightable expression. Most facts were taken from the research
write-up `anime-matrix-research.md` (a separate, private repo), which cites each one. Some were
read directly from the files named below to confirm details (G-Helper's AnimeMatrixDevice.cs
geometry and BuiltInAnimation bits; asusctl's rog-anime image.rs row formulas and pitch values).

- G-Helper (seerge/g-helper), GPL-3.0 — app/AnimeMatrix/*: opcodes, per-row geometry
  formulas, C5 built-in bit layout, planar/diagonal mapping idea.
- asusctl (asus-linux), MPL-2.0 — rog-anime/*: 627-byte pane headers, libusb SET_REPORT
  parameters, physical LED pitch.
- Starlight (vddCore), LGPL-3.0 — origin of the GA402 row formula.
- vddCore's "AniMe Matrix GA402R" protocol write-up — report ID, flush requirement,
  visible-level threshold.

